WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
I don't know him either

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:03,560
I guess he just started treasure hunting.

3
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:04,920
We have so many top experts

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,000
Used it for more than a month

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,840
Every inch of land in Changbai Mountain has been plowed through

6
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:09,640
I haven't even found a human body that lasted three hundred years.

7
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:12,320
Mr. Dayevsky also found only one 90-year-old plant.

8
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,800
There is no human body of three hundred years in Changbai Mountain.

9
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,920
How can a twenty-two-year-old boy find him?

10
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:18,760
I think there’s no need to wait for him, Mr. Fan.

11
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:21,480
Let's arrange a helicopter to take us back first and then wait.

12
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,960
The agreed deadline

13
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:24,240
Ten minutes left

14
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:26,160
Volcanic hole deep in Changbai Mountain

15
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,360
It's filled with nothingness inside

16
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,720
Thick with thorns

17
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:30,320
I went in wearing a gas mask.

18
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:32,000
I almost couldn't get out

19
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,560
If that kid goes in

20
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:40,550
In all likelihood, he is dead. Mr. Fan, look quickly.

21
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:41,830
Why is this guy so fast?

22
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:43,590
The sack is full of things

23
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:46,750
Could it be that he really found someone, Miss Fan?

24
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:48,030
you may be disappointed

25
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:48,990
If it is a human body

26
00:00:48,990 --> 00:00:50,550
Impossible to fill two sacks

27
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,510
It's probably some kind of common medicinal material or something
